WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.444
Importing a spreadsheet.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.874
Bring in the sheet your section already works from.

3
00:00:06.874 --> 00:00:09.774
Vantage keeps the original, unchanged.

4
00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.748
It reads the headings, and guesses what each column means.

5
00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:17.307
Correct anything it got wrong.

6
00:00:17.857 --> 00:00:20.033
Before anything is written,

7
00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:24.023
you see exactly what will happen, row by row.

8
00:00:24.573 --> 00:00:28.843
Import, and every row becomes work in the queue,

9
00:00:28.843 --> 00:00:31.963
traced to the row it came from.

10
00:00:32.513 --> 00:00:36.683
Bring the same file in again, and nothing changes.

11
00:00:36.683 --> 00:00:39.088
That is the right answer.
